- **Circulation Pump (Type114)** → circulates water through heat pump → tank
- **Stratified Storage Tank (Type4a)** → stores hot water for DHW
- **DHW Draw Schedule (Type14h)** → morning DHW draw profile
- **DHW Flow Calculation (EQUATIONS, unit 10)** → computes actual DHW flow
- **Online Plotter (Type65d)** → visualizes results

